{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","title":"NAR script & bytecode inventory (Part 5)","description":"The --json output of `nar script` (Part 5): every script-bearing member of the target, identified by format and reported at the fidelity the format genuinely supports. `supported` records walked the documented structure end to end; `identified_only` records name the reason (encrypted, compressed with a codec the stdlib lacks, no documented entry-count header, custom VM by design). Undecoded bytecode is never presented as source: facts carry header fields, counts and string pools only.","type":"object","additionalProperties":true,"required":["version","target","verdict","files","totals","limitations"],"properties":{"tool":{"type":"string"},"version":{"type":"string"},"target":{"type":"string"},"verdict":{"type":"string","enum":["present","absent"]},"container":{"type":["object","null"]},"files":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true,"required":["file","format","status","fidelity","size_bytes","facts","reason","error"],"properties":{"file":{"type":"string"},"source_archive":{"type":["string","null"]},"format":{"type":"string","enum":["lua","gdscript","dart-snapshot","hermes","javascript","wasm","dotnet-cil","pyc","angelscript","squirrel","pawn","custom-vm","unknown","il2cpp-metadata","python"]},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["supported","identified_only"]},"fidelity":{"type":"string","enum":["source-equivalent","source-approximate","bytecode-listing","structural-summary","identified-only"]},"size_bytes":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"facts":{"type":"object"},"reason":{"type":["string","null"]},"error":{"type":["string","null"]}}}},"totals":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true,"required":["file_count","by_format","by_status"],"properties":{"file_count":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"by_format":{"type":"object"},"by_status":{"type":"object"}}},"limitations":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}}}
